&+R12/13/25
- Added 'taunt' skill to Guardians at level 30.  This is very similar to an MMO
  style taunt skill.  Forces a target to stay focused on you, while they are
  in the room.  Also will force all mobs that aren't ACT_NOLURE to track you
  while they are taunted.  Please test this out and give some feedback!
  * details: requires passing skill check and the target failing a fear save
- Moved 'dreadnaught' to level 41 for Guardians.
- Moved 'shield punch' to level 30 for Guardians.
- Spell 'freedom of movement' is now !combat, also increased casting time from 2 to 4 *s.
- Spell 'thornskin' applies always regardless of other damage shields. Also the spell
  now does double damage when 'ironwood' is active.
- Added new command 'appoint' to appoint leaders in groups.
- Increase bash success chance for water and earth elemental pets.
- Upgrade Sword of Whirlwinds proc.

&+R12/12/25
- Really did fix dim type spell range now.
- Made Mace of the Sea a worthwhile Artifact.
- Alter frag epic bonus calculation to take victim's frags into consideration.
- Dreadnaught skill effectiveness now scales with skill level.
- Dreadnaught now applies 1% to 10% spell damage reduction, scaling with skill level.
- Updated named set proc to remove spells grants when removing the set pieces.
- Implemenation for Dragoon spells:
  * Animae Cicatrix
  * Stigmata Draconica
  * Drakescale Aegis
- Dragoon can now commune in combat.
- Various Dragoon balance changes.
- Another balance pass on The Wreck of the Dreadnaught Cyclops:
  * Slight nerf to some equipment.
  * Made more mobs non-sentinel to get extra roaming.
  * Set extra gold piles in treasure as rare loads.
  * Moved epic stone to floor in first treasure room.


