&+R12/9/25
- Fixed bug with reveal true name
- More Dragoon balancing
- Allow Krindors to be worn on belt.
- Allow bards to play instruments attached to belt.
- Change Disintegrate to ignore shrug.
- Triple attack should now be assigned to warrior at level 51.
- Added new spell 'freedom of movement':
  * 8th circle for Bard, Blighter, Cleric, Druid, Ranger, Reaver
  * target character in room
  * duration of 2-3 minutes depending on caster level
  * removes minor/major para, entangle, and earthen grasp on cast
  * makes base move cost of any room 1 for duration of spell (still modified by position, etc)
  * blocks all sources of minor paralysis at least once (50% chance to consume spell)
  * blocks all sources of major paralysis only once (100% chance to consume spell)
  * blocks all takedown skills at least once (min 50% chance to consume spell, 100% when 10+ levels over victim)

&+R12/7/25
